    "text": "guttenbergpress.com\nwebsite\nNew Hampton\nNew Hampton beats Bulldogs 33-6\n12 hours ago\nThe MFL MarMac football team fell to 0-3 last week, losing its final non-district game 33-6 at New Hampton. The Chickasaws put up 20 unanswered points in the opening two quarters and continued to tack on in the second half. The Bulldogs got on the board in the fourth quarter on an eight-yard touchdown run by quarterback Eli Hanson.",
